      <p>Where <em>C&#8320;</em> is the initial development cost, <em>H</em> is annual hosting cost, <em>M</em> is year-1 maintenance, and <em>g</em> is the annual maintenance growth rate.</p>
      <p>Buy cumulative cost at year <em>y</em>:</p>
